DESCRIPTION:The Duke Cancer Institute's Offices of Cancer Research Trainin
 g & Education (CRTEC) and Community Outreach and Engagement are hosting a
  Cancer Career Exploration Day. The purpose of this event is to showcase 
 a range of exciting career opportunities in cancer-related research and c
 linical care.\n \nDuke CRTEC invites undergraduate students and recent gr
 aduates from our campus to join them for the day at Duke on Saturday\, No
 vember 7\, 2026. \n\nThe event is free but registration is required.
