DESCRIPTION:The Congregation's Racial Equity Group invites you to a "Lunch
  and Learn" at the Nasher on Sunday\, November 8 from 1-3 PM. Their curre
 nt exhibit "Turn the Volume Up" examines how artists\, activists\, and ev
 eryday people have used their voices to challenge injustice. \n\nOur grou
 p will meet near the Nasher front desk at 1:00 to get oriented to the exh
 ibit.  We will gather again after experiencing it to discuss what we have
  to learn from the artists and activists highlighted. \n\nSpaces for this
  event are limited\, so click the "More Event Info" link (below) to sign 
 up soon and reserve your spot!
DURATION:PT2H
DTSTAMP:20260921T172903Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T130000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260921T172903Z
