DESCRIPTION:This short course will emphasize coding and developing AI skil
 ls.  We ask participants to attend both sessions\, since each one builds 
 on the previous session. Given the hands-on nature\, there will not be an
 y Zoom options or recordings. \nSpace is limited so register early if you
  plan to attend.  If there is over subscription\, we will hold a lottery 
 of some type to determine additional participants. You will receive a con
 firmation email indicating you are registered for the workshop.\nThis is 
 part of a broader seminar series\, "AI in Practice: At Duke and Beyond\,"
  run by Rhodes iiD\, OIT Co-Lab and others.  Look for more activities thr
 oughout the year.
DURATION:PT1H
